              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NaseThehafenehesi usuku luyakuba mnyama, lapho ngephula khona amajoka aseGibithe; ubukhazikhazi bamandla akhe buyophela kulo, ifu liyakusibekela, namadodakazi alo aya ekuthunjweni.",
