              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngomnyaka weshumi nanye, ngenyanga yokuqala, ngosuku lwesikhombisa lwenyanga, izwi likaJehova lafika kimi, lathi:",
          "type": "text",
