              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakuqinisa izingalo zenkosi yaseBabele, ngibeke inkemba yami esandleni sayo; kodwa ngiyakuzaphula izingalo zikaFaro, futhi uyobubula phambi kwakhe ngokububula komuntu olimele kakhulu.",
          "type": "text",
