        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha ngiyakuqinisa izingalo zenkosi yaseBabele, izingalo zikaFaro ziwe; ziyakwazi ukuthi nginguJehova, lapho ngibeka inkemba yami esandleni senkosi yaseBabele, iyelulele phezu kwezwe laseGibithe.",
          "type": "text",
